The character artwork
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

avatar.png was generated with Google Gemini from a prompt by the author, and was
not copied from any existing work. avatar-body.svg is a vector tracing of it, made
for this project; it is the version the widget actually renders.

avatar.ico is the same image rescaled for Windows, used as the icon of the desktop
shortcut that shortcut.js creates. docs/whip.gif is a recording of this project's own
widget. Both are derived from avatar.png and carry no separate rights.

Note that in some jurisdictions -- the United States among them -- images produced
by a generative model without meaningful human authorship may not attract copyright
protection at all. Treat the artwork as freely reusable and do not rely on it as a
protectable mark of your own.

