Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Electron (MIT) is used at runtime for the desktop window. It is installed from npm
and is not vendored in this repository. See node_modules/electron/LICENSE after
installation.

Instrument Sans is embedded in widget.html as two woff2 subsets (about 40 KB).
Copyright 2023 The Instrument Sans Project Authors. Licensed under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1, whose full text travels with it in licenses/Instrument-Sans-OFL.txt
as that licence requires.
https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Instrument+Sans

whip.mp3 came from a royalty-free sound library; the exact source was not recorded.
It is used for the whip crack in app mode. Nothing depends on it: if the file is
missing or fails to load, crack() falls back to a synthesised WebAudio crack, so it
can be removed in one commit with no functional change.
